  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "This place feels rather familiar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680069007300200070006C0061006300650020006600650065006C00730020007200610074006800650072002000660061006D0069006C006900610072002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Stuck with my brother even here. Cursed fate.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007400750063006B002000770069007400680020006D0079002000620072006F00740068006500720020006500760065006E00200068006500720065002E002000430075007200730065006400200066006100740065002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oooh, it’s the Fist of Justice leaders! I’ve been\nitching to see more of your Mega Evolutions!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We should have a two-on-two battle! Let’s team\nup, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065002000730068006F0075006C00640020006800610076006500200061002000740077006F002D006F006E002D00740077006F00200062006100740074006C006500210020004C00650074201900730020007400650061006D000A00750070002C00200010000201000000002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, let’s battle!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002C0020006C006500742019007300200062006100740074006C006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s hold off",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200068006F006C00640020006F006600660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aw, c’mon! Just go with the flow!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410077002C002000632019006D006F006E00210020004A00750073007400200067006F00200077006900740068002000740068006500200066006C006F0077002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Can I really say I’m the Mega Evolution successor\nif I don’t seek out every Mega Evolution I can?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I, too, desire battle!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002C00200074006F006F002C002000640065007300690072006500200062006100740074006C0065002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I see protesting would be a waste of my breath.\nLet’s get this over with.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, let’s battle!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002C0020006C006500742019007300200062006100740074006C006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s hold off",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200068006F006C00640020006F006600660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There are places in life you cannot reach without\nclimbing over strong opponents to get there.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Strength is power!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007400720065006E00670074006800200069007300200070006F007700650072002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I took you for someone more decisive.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200074006F006F006B00200079006F007500200066006F007200200073006F006D0065006F006E00650020006D006F00720065002000640065006300690073006900760065002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Strength is justice!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007400720065006E0067007400680020006900730020006A007500730074006900630065002100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Isn’t Lumiose great? It’s such a hotbed of Mega\nEvolution, even in hyperspace!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Time to Mega Evolve, Falinks! Justice WILL win\nthe day!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540069006D006500200074006F0020004D006500670061002000450076006F006C00760065002C002000460061006C0069006E006B007300210020004A007500730074006900630065002000570049004C004C002000770069006E000A0074006800650020006400610079002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chandelure... Mega Evolve. Finish them.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300680061006E00640065006C007500720065002E002E002E0020004D006500670061002000450076006F006C00760065002E002000460069006E0069007300680020007400680065006D002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s give it all we’ve got!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650074201900730020006700690076006500200069007400200061006C006C00200077006520190076006500200067006F0074002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mega Falinks and Mega Chandelure were both so\ngreat!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500670061002000460061006C0069006E006B007300200061006E00640020004D0065006700610020004300680061006E00640065006C0075007200650020007700650072006500200062006F0074006800200073006F000A00670072006500610074002100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I thought our Mega-Evolved power would let us\nsmash our way to victory, but alas...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know, Ivor, Pokémon certainly do get more\nraw power when they Mega Evolve...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "but Trainers still need to know a lot about Mega\nEvolution so they can make the best use of their<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nPokémon’s specific strengths!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Understood! I will train harder!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00640065007200730074006F006F0064002100200049002000770069006C006C00200074007200610069006E0020006800610072006400650072002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Impressive. Ivor doesn’t calm down and follow\nadvice from just anybody.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This experience has moved me deeply. Please, let\nme offer you the uniform of our dojo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whoa, thank you! But I think I’ve got enough\ngoing on already.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068006F0061002C0020007400680061006E006B00200079006F007500210020004200750074002000490020007400680069006E006B0020004920190076006500200067006F007400200065006E006F007500670068000A0067006F0069006E00670020006F006E00200061006C00720065006100640079002E00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m the Shalour City Gym Leader and the Mega\nEvolution successor, plus part of Team MZ!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I already had to drop my roller-skater shtick.\nThink I gotta pass on the Fist of Justice uniform.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Understood. I shall donate the outfit to you, then,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, since it’s going unused.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You received Ivor’s Gi Set!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000720065006300650069007600650064002000490076006F007220190073002000470069002000530065007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ivor. Rude.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490076006F0072002E00200052007500640065002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I will Mega Evolve myself as a Trainer!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000770069006C006C0020004D006500670061002000450076006F006C007600650020006D007900730065006C00660020006100730020006100200054007200610069006E00650072002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I suppose this is a place that can’t be found...\nmost of the time.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200073007500700070006F00730065002000740068006900730020006900730020006100200070006C00610063006500200074006800610074002000630061006E2019007400200062006500200066006F0075006E0064002E002E002E000A006D006F007300740020006F00660020007400680065002000740069006D0065002E00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Being TOO strong can lead to pain.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nBut the bond between Pokémon and Trainer can\novercome that pain!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
